{% set local_problem %}
<p>Many New Hope homes have older gutter systems — sectional gutters that leak at every joint, undersized systems that overflow in heavy rain, or original gutters that have simply reached the end of their lifespan.</p>

<p>New Hope's terrain adds complexity. Sloped lots mean water moves aggressively during storms. If your gutters can't capture and redirect that water, it rushes toward your foundation, causing erosion and potentially damaging your home's structure over time.</p>

<p>Seamless gutters solve these problems at the source. No seams means no leaks. Custom fabrication means gutters that fit your home exactly and move water efficiently, even on challenging rooflines.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Seamless gutters are continuous gutters with no joints except at corners and downspouts. We bring our portable gutter machine to your New Hope property and fabricate each run to the exact length needed — right in your driveway.</p>

<p>This approach means gutters that truly fit your home. No forcing pre-cut sections together, no excess seams, no compromise. The result is better performance, cleaner appearance, and dramatically longer life than sectional alternatives.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
